  <name>blunderDB</name>
  <summary>Backgammon blunder analysis tool</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      blunderDB is a desktop application (GUI and CLI) for importing, storing,
      searching and studying backgammon positions from eXtreme Gammon, GnuBG,
      BGBlitz and Jellyfish.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Import matches from eXtreme Gammon (.xg/.xgp), GnuBG (.sgf), BGBlitz (.bgf) and Jellyfish (.mat)</li>
      <li>Search positions by checker structure, pip count, equity, error threshold, dice and contact</li>
      <li>Spaced-repetition (FSRS/Anki-style) flash cards for position review</li>
      <li>Effective Pip Count calculator with embedded GnuBG one-sided bearoff database</li>
      <li>Collections, tournaments and Match Equity Tables</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">blunderdb.desktop</launchable>

